  "body": "The [distinguishability table](https://heycam.github.io/webidl/#distinguishable-table) currently shows `(b)` at the bigint + bigint cell. I’m pretty sure this is a typo — it seems like it’s really supposed to be at numeric + bigint.\r\n\r\n![Screenshot of the distinguishability matrix with a red arrow showing which cell the B is supposed to be in](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/6257356/128647895-648574d4-17b0-4eb2-ba10-ed2485c31c66.png)\r\n",
